18) WHEN TO USE CRDTs (INTERVIEW GOLD)
===============================================================================

Use when:
- high availability required
- offline support needed
- conflicts expected
- eventual consistency acceptable

Examples:
- chat apps
- collaborative editing
- counters
- social features
- analytics

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DON'T USE WHEN:
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

- bank balance
- transactions
- strict ordering needed
- strong consistency required

