19) OP vs STATE CRDT (INTERVIEW COMPARISON)
===============================================================================

OP-CRDT:
+ low bandwidth
+ efficient
- requires strong delivery guarantees

STATE-CRDT:
+ simple
+ tolerant to duplicates
+ easy with gossip
- heavy state transfer

